---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import HeroPhoto from '../components/HeroPhoto.astro';
import RouteMap from '../components/RouteMap.astro';
import PackArt from '../components/PackArt.astro';
import Inquiry from '../components/Inquiry.astro';
---
<Base title="Nani Pup — Alpine Dog Care, Adventures & Dog Photography in Slovenia" description="Private alpine dog care, Adventure Days, dog + family photography and dog-friendly Slovenia Field Notes around Kranjska Gora, Lake Bled, Bohinj, Gorenjska and Ljubljana." alternateEn="/" alternateSl="/sl/">
<section class="hero">
  <div class="rail">ALPINE DOG CARE · STORIES · SLOVENIA</div>
  <div class="heroMain">
    <div class="eyebrow">Inspired by Nani / Alpine care & stories</div>
    <h1 class="mega">NANI <span class="pup">Pup.</span></h1>
    <div class="sub">Good care. Wilder days. <em>More adventures together.</em></div>
    <p class="intro">Nani Pup grew from one dog and the places she loved. Today we care for your dogs, take suitable dogs onto those same alpine paths, photograph the bond you share and pass on useful local knowledge for life and travel with a dog in Slovenia.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="pill dark" href="#care">Explore Alpine Care →</a><a class="pill" href="/dog-family-photography-slovenia/">See Nani Memories</a></div>
    <div class="stamp"><div><strong>Alpine</strong><br/>Bled · Bohinj<br/>Kranjska Gora</div></div>
  </div>
  <HeroPhoto />
</section>
<div class="ticker"><div>✦ ALPINE CARE &nbsp; ✦ ADVENTURE DAYS &nbsp; ✦ DOG + FAMILY PHOTOGRAPHY &nbsp; ✦ FIELD NOTES &nbsp; ✦ KRANJSKA GORA &nbsp; ✦ BLED &nbsp; ✦ BOHINJ &nbsp; ✦ GORENJSKA &nbsp; ✦ NANI GOODS &nbsp;</div></div>

<section class="statement naniStory">
 <div class="big"><div class="kicker">01 / Inspired by Nani</div><h2>The dog who gave Nani Pup its <em>name, heart and reason to exist.</em></h2></div>
 <div class="sidecopy"><p>Nani loved the kind of days dogs understand best: cool forest paths, lake air, long sniffing stops and a human close by. The places she loved became the beginning of Nani Pup. We still return to them now — only the pack is a little bigger.</p><div class="proofs"><div class="proof"><b>care</b><span>Calm, personal care shaped around the dog in front of us.</span></div><div class="proof"><b>trails</b><span>Places Nani knew and loved, shared thoughtfully with yours.</span></div><div class="proof"><b>stories</b><span>Photographs and little memories worth keeping.</span></div></div></div>
</section>

<section class="services" id="care">
 <div class="sectionHead"><div><div class="kicker">02 / Alpine Care</div><h2>Care for the day<br/>they actually need.</h2></div><p>Private, small-capacity care for travellers and locals. Sometimes that means a quiet walk and a nap. Sometimes it means a whole alpine adventure.</p></div>
 <div class="serviceRows">
  <a class="service" href="/dog-sitting-bled-slovenia/"><span class="num">A</span><h3>Private Nani Care</h3><p>Walks, company, meals, rest and a familiar rhythm while you are away.</p><span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
  <a class="service" href="/dog-adventure-day-slovenia/"><span class="num">B</span><h3>Alpine Adventure Day</h3><p>Your dog gets their own carefully planned outing while you have yours.</p><span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
  <a class="service" href="/wedding-dog-concierge-slovenia/"><span class="num">C</span><h3>Wedding Dog Concierge</h3><p>Transport, calm handling, portraits, breaks and care around your wedding day.</p><span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
  <a class="service" href="/dog-sitting-bohinj/"><span class="num">D</span><h3>Bohinj & Alpine Stays</h3><p>Private care around Bohinj and selected Gorenjska stays by enquiry.</p><span class="arrow">↗</span></a>
 </div>
</section>

<RouteMap />

<section class="adventure">
 <div class="adventureCopy"><div class="kicker">04 / Nani Adventure Day</div><h2>They get an adventure, too.</h2><p>More than dog sitting. We collect your dog and create a few good hours around their age, fitness and temperament: forest trails, sniffing, movement, water, quiet time and updates for you. No summit to prove. The route belongs to the dog.</p><div class="actions"><a class="pill" href="/dog-adventure-day-slovenia/">Explore Adventure Day →</a><a class="pill" href="#inquiry">Ask for your dates</a></div></div>
 <div class="adventureTicket"><div class="eyebrow">NANI FIELD TICKET / 001</div><div class="ticketTitle">Alpine Adventure Day</div><div class="ticketList"><div>✓ 3–4 hour tailored outing</div><div>✓ Kranjska Gora / Bled / Bohinj by enquiry</div><div>✓ water, breaks & calm enrichment</div><div>✓ photo + message updates</div><div>✓ route adapted to weather & dog</div></div><div class="ticketPrice">from €160</div></div>
</section>

<section class="memories" id="memories"><div class="memGrid"><div class="postcards"><div class="card one"><div class="photoMock photoMockDog"></div></div><div class="card two"><div class="photoMock photoMockFamily"></div></div></div><div class="memCopy"><div class="kicker">05 / Nani Memories</div><h2>Keep the chapter you are in.</h2><p>Natural dog + family photography around Lake Bled, Bohinj, Kranjska Gora and the Slovenian Alps. A walk, a favourite place, your people and the dog who belongs in the middle of it — no stiff pet-portrait feeling required.</p><div class="pricebig">Sessions from €300</div><a class="pill dark" href="/dog-family-photography-slovenia/">Explore Nani Memories →</a></div></div></section>

<section class="journal" id="journal"><div class="sectionHead"><div><div class="kicker">06 / Nani Field Notes</div><h2>Things we learned<br/>by actually being there.</h2></div><p>Local dog-friendly notes from the places we know: where a day feels easy, what to consider before a route, how to travel more calmly with a dog and when a few hours of private care can make everyone happier.</p></div><div class="journalGrid">
<a class="story" href="/journal/dog-friendly-bled/"><span class="tag">Lake Bled</span><div><h3>Dog-Friendly Bled</h3><p>Walks, lake time, local practicalities and ways to plan a relaxed day together.</p></div><span class="read">Read Field Note →</span></a>
<a class="story" href="/journal/dog-friendly-kranjska-gora/"><span class="tag">Kranjska Gora</span><div><h3>Kranjska Gora with a dog</h3><p>Alpine walks, protected-area etiquette and realistic route planning.</p></div><span class="read">Read Field Note →</span></a>
<a class="story" href="/journal/dog-friendly-bohinj/"><span class="tag">Bohinj</span><div><h3>Bohinj with a dog</h3><p>Water, shade, slower lake days and planning around nature and summer heat.</p></div><span class="read">Read Field Note →</span></a>
<a class="story" href="/journal/travelling-slovenia-with-dog/"><span class="tag">Slovenia road trip</span><div><h3>Travelling Slovenia with your dog</h3><p>A calmer way to plan stays, hikes, meals, transfers and rest days.</p></div><span class="read">Read Field Note →</span></a>
</div><div class="actions" style="margin-top:36px"><a class="pill dark" href="/journal/">Open all Field Notes →</a><a class="pill" href="/challenge/">Try the free 7-day challenge</a></div></section>

<section class="challenge compactChallenge"><div class="challengeTop"><div><div class="kicker">07 / Learn with Nani</div><h2>One small thing.<i>Together.</i></h2></div><div class="challengeIntro">The free 7-day challenge gives you one practical exercise a day — short enough for real life, useful enough to bring into normal walks and everyday routines.<br/><br/><a class="pill dark" href="/challenge/">Join the free challenge →</a></div></div></section>

<section class="shop softSell" id="shop"><div class="shopLead"><div class="kicker">08 / Nani Goods</div><h2>Take a little of the Nani way home.</h2><p>A small collection for people who like thoughtful dog things: local guides, richer walks, memories and eventually a quiet Nani WALK line. No giant pet-shop catalogue.</p><div class="fieldseal">small<br/>useful<br/>beautiful</div></div><div class="products">
<a class="product sun" href="/shop/"><span class="type">Digital guide</span><div><h3>Dog-Friendly Bled</h3><p>A practical local guide for better days around the lake.</p></div><span class="price">€19</span></a>
<a class="product" href="/shop/"><span class="type">Walk & learn</span><div><h3>Adventure Cards</h3><p>Small games and prompts for richer everyday walks.</p></div><span class="price">€12</span></a>
<a class="product" href="/shop/"><span class="type">Keepsake</span><div><h3>Nani Memory Journal</h3><p>For the tiny habits and stories you never want to forget.</p></div><span class="price">€29</span></a>
<a class="product dark" href="/shop/"><span class="type">Coming from Nani WALK</span><div><h3>Quiet alpine essentials</h3><p>Minimal harnesses, leads and everyday pieces designed for comfortable adventures.</p></div><span class="price">COMING SOON</span></a>
</div></section>

<section class="packSection"><div class="packCopy"><div class="kicker">09 / The pack grows</div><h2>Nani started the story.<br/><em>Your dogs keep it moving.</em></h2><p>Every dog brings a different pace, a different favourite smell and a different idea of a perfect day. That is exactly the point.</p></div><PackArt /></section>

<Inquiry />
</Base>
